        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Judges 16:15",
        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass, when she pressed him daily with her words, and urged him, so that his soul was vexed unto death;",
        "footNotes": [
